        "TileImage": "$($repository 2de69518-5954-4608-b2c4-462b89b0bd99).Image",
        "Description": "Good Morning 47.\r\rYour mission,  codenamed:  “Trackside Takedown,” takes place during the Global Innovation Race. The event, while showcasing high-tech competition, hides a deep-rooted plot that ICA is yet unaware of,  but we do know that a syndicate is operating in the area.\r\rYour mission is to eliminate 3 syndicate members who are manipulating the race to guarantee Moses Lee’s win.\r\r\rBe cautious, 47. The race is under intense security. I&apos;ll leave you to prepare\r\rGood luck.",
